# The ml/ subproject: ~11 GB of weights/datasets alongside its source. Untracked
# wholesale so `git add -A` cannot walk it (it hung on exactly that). If its
# SOURCE should be versioned, track it deliberately rather than by unignoring
# this — the data underneath must never enter the history.
/ml/

